### 3. Hard-coded Ports ⚠️ CRITICAL

**Location:** `src/main/java/com/test/MiniApp.java:15`

**Code:**
```java
private static final int SERVER_PORT = 8080;
```

**Also at:** `src/main/java/com/test/MiniApp.java:79`
```java
ServerSocket serverSocket = new ServerSocket(SERVER_PORT);
```

**Impact:**
- AWS ECS uses dynamic port mapping - fixed ports cause conflicts
- Cannot run multiple instances on same EC2 host
- Application Load Balancer (ALB) health checks fail with fixed ports
- ECS service discovery requires dynamic port configuration
- Prevents deployment in ECS Fargate which assigns random ports

